  "lyrics_zh": {
    "Everyday we talk a little less": "我们每天聊得越来越少",
    "It looks like you are losing interest": "你好像对我失去了兴趣",
    "These feelings I have for you": "我对你的这份心意",
    "But you don't feel the same": "你却没有同样的感受",
    "So I'll pack all my things": "所以我收拾好所有行李",
    "And go run far away": "逃到很远的地方",
    "You are, you are very pretty": "你呀，你真的很漂亮",
    "I'm so very ugly": "而我却那么难看",
    "Will you even love me anymore?": "你还会爱我吗？",
    "You can, you can live without me": "你呀，没有我也能过得很好",
    "That makes me unhappy": "这让我很不开心",
    "I should get a piercing through my heart": "不如在心上穿个孔",
    "What do you even want me to be?": "你到底想让我变成什么样？",
    "You never ever pay attention to me": "你从来都不曾注意过我",
    "So I'll close my blinds in misery": "于是我拉上窗帘，独自难过",
    "And I'll wait for you for a couple of weeks": "再等你几个星期"
